Bakudan Dashboard Cline Rules

Workspace:
- Open only this project root: E:\Project\Master\Bakudan\dashboard.bakudanramen.com
- Do not use Desktop, Downloads, Documents, or parent folders as the workspace.

Source layout:
- There is no app/ directory in this project.
- Config files are under config/.
- The safety guard file is config/safety-guard.php.
- The database config file is config/database.php.
- Never reference app/config/safety-guard.php.

PHP validation:
- Use C:\xampp\php\php.exe for PHP CLI on this Windows machine.
- For syntax checks, run scripts/php-lint.ps1 instead of hand-writing php -l commands.
- If C:\xampp\php\php.exe is missing, stop and report the missing PHP binary. Do not guess another command.

Task discipline:
- One objective per task.
- Do not combine source audit, security audit, database migration, quota audit, and UI QA in one task.
- Before editing, inspect the exact file path with rg --files.
- If a requested path does not exist, report "PATH_NOT_FOUND" and stop. Do not invent an equivalent path.
- Output command results directly. Do not claim validation without command output.
